<title>HONG KONG: ABN AMRO Bank sets warrants on CITIC.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO Bank sets warrants on CITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Thursday it intended to issue 230 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$45	 PREMIUM	 14.5 pct</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.653    GEARING	 6.9X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	02.JAN.98   MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG   PAYMENT DATE  2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  HK$45</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS   HG ASIA LTD</p>
<p>		     DAO HENG SECURITIES LTD</p>
<p>		     TAI FOOK SECURITIES CO LTD</p>
<p> NOTE		CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>		     ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
